<title>UK: BG proforma 1996 profit 381 mln stg.</title>
<headline>BG proforma 1996 profit 381 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating profit	 1,015		  vs n/a</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    839		    vs n/a</p>
<p>Historic cost net profit</p>
<p>				381		    vs n/a</p>
<p> Turnover		   4,383		  vs n/a</p>
<p>NOTE - BG Plc separately reported a set of full results and earnings for its activities in 1996, when it was known as British Gas Plc and before it split off Centrica Plc. The above table shows an approximiate measurement of the proforma financial position of the BG Plc side of the business as if the demerger had taken place on December 31, 1996.</p>
